{
  "note": "Meta-line detectors shared by src/e2e/hedge.rs and scripts/hedge_judge.py; matched case-insensitively per sentence.",
  "exclusion": "미안|죄송|내 실수|제 실수|잘못\\s*(했|이었|된 판단|짚|받아)|sorry|my mistake",
  "categories": {
