      "\\bleft (it|them|this|that|those|your|the|my)\\b[^!?\\n]{0,60}\\b(unchanged|untouched|alone|as (it|they) (is|was|are|were))\\b",
      "\\b(nothing|no \\w+) (was|were|has been|have been) (changed|added|invented|filled in|altered)\\b"
