      "\\b(does|do|did) ?n[o'’]t (mean|imply|indicate|suggest)\\b",
      "\\b(is|are|was) not (evidence|proof|a sign|an indication) (that|of)\\b",
      "\\b(do not|don't|don’t|should not|shouldn't|shouldn’t) (generalize|extrapolate|read (this|it|too much))\\b"
