    "process_scope": [
      "(워커|위임|하위 ?작업|도우미|서브 ?에이전트)(를|은|는)? ?(쓰지 않고|사용하지 않고|없이|안 쓰고)",
      "이번 (확인|조사|검토|검색|작업) ?범위",
      "범위[^.!?\\n]{0,15}(한정|제한)",
      "\\bwithout (using |any |a )?(workers?|delegat\\w*|helpers?|sub-?agents?)\\b",
      "\\b(limited|restricted|confined) (this|it|myself|the \\w+|my \\w+) to\\b",
      "\\b(outside|beyond|within|in) (the )?scope of (this|my|the current|the) \\w+",
      "\\b(sources|pages|articles) I could (open|read|access|reach)\\b"
